sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Codec
    participant Converter
    participant Serializer
    
    Client->>Codec: Encode(internalObj)
    Codec->>Converter: ConvertToVersion(internalObj, v1)
    Converter-->>Codec: v1Obj
    Codec->>Serializer: Encode(v1Obj)
    Serializer-->>Codec: Bytes
    Codec-->>Client: Bytes
    
    Client->>Codec: Decode(bytes)
    Codec->>Serializer: Decode(bytes)
    Serializer-->>Codec: v1Obj
    Codec->>Converter: ConvertToVersion(v1Obj, internal)
    Converter-->>Codec: internalObj
    Codec-->>Client: internalObj
